{
  "_comment": "Hand-labeled from GitHub REST semantics BEFORE the matcher was written. `accept` = tools that can validly supply the value (any one counts as a hit). `reject` = plausible-looking producers that are wrong (wrong entity, wrong scope, or circular). Producers not listed in either are 'unjudged' and only reported. `negatives` = required params that must get NO edge. `ambiguous` = judgment calls, reported but never scored.",
